  "label": "intended audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the white supremacist or racially prejudiced community who may find racist stereotypes and slurs entertaining or validating. The visual of the stern-faced man with crossed arms is used to embody the hateful stereotype being described, which is intended to resonate with those who hold or enjoy anti-Black racist views. The use of the racial slur 'nigger' and the false stereotype that Black people are hypersensitive to its smell is a direct appeal to those who perpetuate or find amusement in racial dehumanization. The meme's hateful intent and toxic message are crafted to reinforce existing prejudices and potentially incite hostility toward Black individuals, making it specifically aimed at audiences who are receptive to or supportive of such racist ideologies.",
